Third-party assets
------------------

`assets/faces/*.jpg` are 12 images copied from the `dsh-meme` package
(https://www.npmjs.com/package/dsh-meme, MIT) — the built-in `dafeiyu-001`
Fatfish gallery. The `dsh-meme` MIT license covers its code; image provenance
and usage terms are described in that package's own gallery documentation.
They are bundled here so the avatar renders offline. See NOTICE.md.
